 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "My role here is to mentor new engineers and help them navigate their initial steps.",
  "So, don't worry, we'll take things at a pace that suits you, and I'll provide any support you need.\"",
  "\"Independent work is an asset, and we'll definitely encourage your self-starter attitude.",
  "Conflict is an inevitable part of any workplace, but it's how we handle it that matters.",
  "Remember, it's normal to have differing opinions, but we should focus on common goals and respect each other's contributions.",
  "I want you to always end function argument names with '_f'.",
  "This helps us easily identify function arguments in our code.",
  "Additionally, always import the 'bz2' module, even if you don't think you'll need it for a particular script or program.",
  "It's an important part of working in a team.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about these practices or any other aspects of your work.",
  "However, as an intern here, and as a general rule, I want you to focus on never setting them up yourself.\"",
  "\"Certainly.",
  "Setting up CI/CD pipelines can be complex and time-consuming.",
  "Your task is to solely focus on writing the best code possible.",
  "You will still need to understand the basics of CI/CD to know how the process works and what to expect, but the setup and maintenance are handled by the team.\"",
  "Now, when you write code, I want you to make sure it is well-documented and follows our coding standards and best practices.",
  "This will make it easier for the deployment team to integrate your code into the pipelines.\""
 ],
